      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Drive alongside the high recovery eye of a tipped trailer and press ACTION
    to hook your physical winch cable. Hold ACTION to reel while braking or driving
    to pull the load upright; press ACTION again to release. A cable transmits force
    at the trailer roof eye, so truck position matters. Once upright, clear the cable,
    position ahead of the trailer, straighten and reverse the fifth wheel beneath
    its kingpin. Hold ACTION near the aligned kingpin to lock the native hitch. Tow
    to your lit depot and stop the upright load for two seconds. A touch or cable-only
    arrival never scores. In cooperative play the team must recover every active
    load; teammates may assist other unclaimed loads, and cooperative success awards
    no individual winner points.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
